    "type": "game",
    "name": "Desktop Forest",
    "steam_appid": 3689060,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/3f24d17b0e3e522da161654abb4a1f44.poster.avif?t=1754080822\" width=615 height=483 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/3f24d17b0e3e522da161654abb4a1f44.webm?t=1754080822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a mini forest that keeps you company while you work, study, or play. Drop the window anywhere, resize it to fit, and watch leaves sway as soft audio drifts through your room. Simple, soothing, and somewhat light on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>What is it?</u></i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Chill trees :</strong>\u00a0Grow an endless combination of nice crunchy pixel forests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Regrow Anytime :</strong> Resprout the grove whenever you're bored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Recolor :</strong> Shift from spring greens to flaming fall reds or wild neon pixels with a click.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>2 Art styles :</strong> Nostalgic lofi psx pixels or hand drawn noir!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Pick the perfect View :</strong> Close up, wide panoramas, find the shot that feels right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle Audio :</strong> Hours of calm music  with birds, wind, and gentle nature sounds. Mute or mix.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch Desktop Forest and let nature keep you company all day!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/3f24d17b0e3e522da161654abb4a1f44.poster.avif?t=1754080822\" width=615 height=483 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689060/extras/3f24d17b0e3e522da161654abb4a1f44.webm?t=1754080822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow a mini forest that keeps you company while you work, study, or play. Drop the window anywhere, resize it to fit, and watch leaves sway as soft audio drifts through your room. Simple, soothing, and somewhat light on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>What is it?</u></i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Chill trees :</strong>\u00a0Grow an endless combination of nice crunchy pixel forests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Regrow Anytime :</strong> Resprout the grove whenever you're bored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Recolor :</strong> Shift from spring greens to flaming fall reds or wild neon pixels with a click.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>2 Art styles :</strong> Nostalgic lofi psx pixels or hand drawn noir!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Pick the perfect View :</strong> Close up, wide panoramas, find the shot that feels right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle Audio :</strong> Hours of calm music  with birds, wind, and gentle nature sounds. Mute or mix.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch Desktop Forest and let nature keep you company all day!</p>",
    "short_description": "Desktop Forest turns any corner of your screen into a living woodland. Regrow, recolor, and relax to hours of calm music and gentle nature sounds.",
